00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:55.420
Here is how it works when a contract is used as a hedge rather than as a standalone wager.

00:02:55.980 --> 00:03:00.040
The contract pays if a stated outcome occurs and pays nothing if it does not.

00:03:00.040 --> 00:03:05.440
The hedge is the idea that this payoff offsets a loss on something the holder already has.

00:03:05.860 --> 00:03:09.240
The price is what the other side will take to accept the leftover risk.

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:21.500
Good authority, citing Marika de Gota's book Virtue Fortune Faith, says 19th century regulators split bucket shop gambling from legitimate futures by asking whether losses could be quantified and modeled.

00:03:21.960 --> 00:03:24.140
In that account, a gambler faces the house.

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:28.020
A hedger shifts risk to someone who's appetite for that risk is different.

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:32.720
A 2020 paper in the journal Risks does the arithmetic of a second trade.

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:36.400
After the price moves, take the opposite position to the first one.

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:41.200
The paper's result is that a profit can be locked in without any forecast of the final

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:41.620
outcome.

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:45.220
Two frictions break it, and exchange charges of fee.

00:03:45.680 --> 00:03:49.980
Some markets have no lay option, so there is no way to take the against side at all.

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:57.200
A 2026 paper on RXIB uses Bitcoin as the proof of concept, and treats Kalshi contracts on

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:59.620
the coin's future price as option-like hedges.

00:03:59.940 --> 00:04:03.040
The regimes it builds are bullish, bearish, and flat.

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:08.480
A dynamic mix of those contracts and the spot coin beat simpler portfolios in all three,

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:09.740
the author's report.

00:04:10.260 --> 00:04:12.240
They also say fees can eat that result.

00:04:12.820 --> 00:04:14.900
That is a finding about those constructions.

00:04:15.300 --> 00:04:16.720
It is not a plan to copy.

